p\",\"fontSize\":\"32\"},{\"text\":\"grim\",\"fontSize\":\"32\"},{\"text\":\"spot\",\"fontSize\":\"32\"}]}", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 35468775, "text": "<h2>Warmup:</h2>\nChange the vowel to make new words!\n<br></br>\n<ol>\n<li>Read the word.</li>\n<li>Spot the vowel.</li>\n<li>Change the vowel to make another real word.</li>\n<li>Repeat with the other words.</li>\n</ol>", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 35468282, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"inputArray": [[]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 35468940, "text": "<h2>Challenge:</h2>\nWrite a poem using only one vowel!\n<br></br>\n<ol>\n<li>Choose a vowel.</li>\n<li>Write a list of words that contain that vowel and no other vowels. The longer your list, the better!</li>\n<li>Use your words to make a poem that contains no vowels apart from the one you have chosen.</li>\n</ol> \n<br></br>\nHere are some example lines from this special kind of poem (called a Univocal Poem). You could use one as your starting line if you wanted!\n\n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 35468282, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"inputArray": [[]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 40853923, "text": "Always at a party…\n<br></br>  \nNever grey, ever green…\n<br></br>      \nStill, if I blink, I miss it…\n<br></br>                           \nOnly old schools or odd socks…\n<br></br>                                                   \nMuch junk bumps up, jumps up…\n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 4, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": 32, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 35468282, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<p><span style=\"font-size:32px;font-family:SassoonInfantRg-Regular;\">Always at a party…\n<br></br>  \nNever grey, ever green…\n<br></br>      \nStill, if I blink, I miss it…\n<br></br>                           \nOnly old schools or odd socks…\n<br></br>                                                   \nMuch junk bumps up, jumps up…\n</span></p>", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}]